From 6d458396f050607652610fdc830e3efb6d4a4929 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:31:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/db: Scope backup records to their owner
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Backup rows were found by name alone, and the name is only unique per
instance, volume or bucket, so a backup in one project could delete or
rename the same-named record of another project.

This addresses GHSA-8m9x-vx2q-7f9q (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 0a15c167f04dab6c90339a517ec5d12797c8e6c6)
---
 cmd/incusd/backup.go                      |  21 ++-
 internal/server/backup/backup_bucket.go   |   4 +-
 internal/server/backup/backup_instance.go |   4 +-
 internal/server/backup/backup_volume.go   |   4 +-
 internal/server/db/backups.go             | 148 ++++++++++------------
 5 files changed, 88 insertions(+), 93 deletions(-)

